WEBVTT

00:27:29.746 --> 00:27:34.996
but I guess that criticism would have come
even if I'd been a male student,

00:27:34.996 --> 00:27:40.746
I guess. And Leakey wanted me because
I was a female and because I had

00:27:40.746 --> 00:27:47.121
an unbiased mind. And the when I got
tempted, it was just becoming independent.

00:27:47.496 --> 00:27:51.204
So there was resentment towards
the white males who dominated

00:27:51.496 --> 00:27:56.413
the country for so long, but a white
female. And they wanted to help me.

00:27:57.663 --> 00:28:04.621
So I didn't have this, you know, when when
there were these male scientists,